+Total Capital = Market Cap + Total Debt
+Equity Weight = Market Cap / Total Capital
+Debt Weight = Total Debt / Total Capital
 WACC = (Cost of Equity × Equity Weight) + (After-tax Cost of Debt × Debt Weight)
